    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/f49bb1ac3a5a331aabae11b3d9441c6c.poster.avif?t=1727361332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/f49bb1ac3a5a331aabae11b3d9441c6c.webm?t=1727361332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/f49bb1ac3a5a331aabae11b3d9441c6c.mp4?t=1727361332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Chinchillas Attack Again is a challenging metroidvania game where we control the Duck, a simple, exotic and alcoholic guy, along with a cloud with a completely opposite personality of the duck, being all that separates Duck from complete madness. Together, they embark on an adventure to exterminate all <strong><i>CHINCHILLAS</i></strong>, who, after an attack, are taking over the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Elements</h2><br>\u2729 5 Large Areas to Explore.<br><br>\u2729 Battles against Challenging Bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/ee1c23e4c26c57a756eec4c887846b58.poster.avif?t=1727361332\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/ee1c23e4c26c57a756eec4c887846b58.webm?t=1727361332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149830/extras/ee1c23e4c26c57a756eec4c887846b58.mp4?t=1727361332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2729 Secrets hidden throughout the map.<br><br>\u2729 Charismatic characters and story.<br><br>\u2729 Future content updates.<br><br>\u2729 Completely original pixelated graphics.",
